# Outlook Initiating Outbound SMB/WebDAV to External Host (CVE-2023-23397 pattern) | T1187 | Hub
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=3 Image="*\\OUTLOOK.EXE" (DestinationPort IN (445, 139)) NOT (DestinationIp="10.0.0.0/8" OR DestinationIp="172.16.0.0/12" OR DestinationIp="192.168.0.0/16" OR DestinationIp="127.0.0.0/8")
